  "description": "Compact JSON serialization for Microsoft Dynamics 365/CRM/Dataverse entities. Includes support for AliasedValue (FetchXML linked entities), OptionSetValueCollection (multi-select), BooleanManagedProperty, and all standard CRM data types. Plugin compatible (.NET 4.6.2).",
