  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.2026.9.0 (September 2026):\n- FIX: ~240x faster bulk serialization. The converters no longer allocate a new\n  XrmContractResolver per call, which was discarding Newtonsoft's per-instance\n  contract cache and re-resolving every type by reflection on every entity.\n  100 000 entities: 82.31 s -> 0.34 s, byte-identical output.\n- TESTS: 9 new tests pinning resolver sharing and bulk throughput.\n- DOCS: New Performance section on settings reuse and the DefaultSettings factory pitfall.\n- No change to the JSON format, the public API or the target framework - drop-in upgrade.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
